   "updated": 1763424000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Reels tab: only first 12 Reels logged-out → plays for ~5 of 21 Reels\n    (Meta view_count fixes this once the token is set)\n• No 'Paid partnership' label logged-out → rely on #ad/#collab + co-authors\n• Unknown counterparts (@someone) default to 'unknown' → grow config/brands.csv\n• Themes are keyword rules (topics.json) → later: LLM / vision / transcripts\n• 300 req/h web cap is a guess → tune after the 10-account pilot (status cmd)\n• No audience data (city/age/gender) → creator-consented Instagram Login\n• Scheduling is manual → launchd/cron weekly `run --due`\n• Full runs paginate timeline even with Meta OK (to find brand-owned collabs)\n    → could skip when the account rarely has collabs",
   "originalText": "• Reels tab: only first 12 Reels logged-out → plays for ~5 of 21 Reels\n    (Meta view_count fixes this once the token is set)\n• No 'Paid partnership' label logged-out → rely on #ad/#collab + co-authors\n• Unknown counterparts (@someone) default to 'unknown' → grow config/brands.csv\n• Themes are keyword rules (topics.json) → later: LLM / vision / transcripts\n• 300 req/h web cap is a guess → tune after the 10-account pilot (status cmd)\n• No audience data (city/age/gender) → creator-consented Instagram Login\n• Scheduling is manual → launchd/cron weekly `run --due`\n• Full runs paginate timeline even with Meta OK (to find brand-owned collabs)\n    → could skip when the account rarely has collabs",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "gaps",
   "autoResize": true,
